									<h1> <center></h1> <h2> <table width="100%" border="5"> <tbody> <tr> <td><img src="/pics/2151/corvkill1.JPG" /></td> <td><font color="#f5f5dc">Another day, another Elder God kill. Last night we ventured into the depths of Water to visit our old friend Corinav and we didn't leave until we were all having our fill of freshly served sushi. Grats again all on a great kill. 3 Down, 1 to go!</font></td></tr></tbody></table></h2></center>
